+The same reasoning applies to every other marginal comparison in a form that is easy to miss. Dropping a scenario cell removes all constructors together, but it removes only \emph{one} selection variant and \emph{one} improver, since those
+identify the cell. Marginal tables over those stages are therefore additionally
+restricted to the slices in which every level of the compared stage actually
+ran. The six numerical tables reproduce from the archived summaries using
+the centralized filtering and balancing rules. Regeneration checks
+transcription and aggregation, not the validity of historical runs under
+the corrected implementations. Presentation-sourced graphics retain the
+separate raw-data caveats in their captions.
